  "description": "Enhance your long rides with the Roadmachine 01 AMP X ONE, a road e-bike crafted to expand your horizons. Experience boosted performance with the top-of-the-line TQ-HPR50 drive system (class 3), complemented by a premium carbon frame and fork featuring the latest Tuned Compliance Concept Endurance technology. Enjoy comfort on various terrains, thanks to internal cable routing, a high-quality carbon D-Shape seatpost, generous tire clearance, and the advanced ICS MTT x Redshift Suspension stem. Blaze your own trail with the Roadmachine 01 AMP X ONE, equipped with the SRAM Force XPLR eTap AXS 12-speed groupset, 35 mm Pirelli Cinturato Gravel tires, and the powerful TQ-HPR50 drive unit.",
